        -> Player: Well it was a camera, so just checking there isn't a creep in the building.
            Resident: ... You calling me a creep?
            -> Player: No, just trying to figure out what's going on.
                Resident: I don't know, but i'm busy.
                    -> Player: Sorry!
            -> Player: Are you?
                Resident: GET OUT OF HERE.
                    -> Player: Sorry!
        -> Player: Yeah, of course.. Sorry for wasting your time.
